print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">ChatGPT dijo:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ab2e6f5-1de0-83e8-8618-ede164369d7e" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="4191b2f7-9e82-4138-b0b8-5af0ba1a0cec"><span hidden=""></span><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_18s_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="4191b2f7-9e82-4138-b0b8-5af0ba1a0cec" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="4191b2f7-9e82-4138-b0b8-5af0ba1a0cec"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Ahí te señalé en la imagen las partes que debés revisar para la <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Lección 1 de la Semana 16</span>: longitud total, espesor, diámetros de los cuatro agujeros y cajetín.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">También comprobá que el plano tenga las vistas y las cotas legibles.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">📸 Guardá tu captura original como <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">S16_E1_Revision_Plano_Calibrador.png</code>.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Ojo:</span> en tu captura el nombre del archivo tiene un asterisco (<code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">*</code>), lo que indica cambios sin guardar. Presioná <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Ctrl + S</span> después de terminar la revisión.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Cuando estés listo, seguimos con el plano del soporte. 💗</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-primary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-primary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 butto